WEBVTT

01:29.620 --> 01:33.150
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.700 --> 01:36.150
[Episode 17]

02:13.440 --> 02:15.960
I told you before—
whoever loses the competition

02:15.960 --> 02:18.120
will be punished.

02:24.660 --> 02:27.740
I'll give you one night
to think it over.

02:27.960 --> 02:29.320
By dawn,

02:29.560 --> 02:31.440
I expect to see a corpse.

02:31.460 --> 02:33.460
And if there isn't one

02:33.840 --> 02:36.030
by tomorrow morning?

02:37.079 --> 02:38.130
Then I'll have

02:38.280 --> 02:40.190
to collect all your bodies.

03:52.210 --> 03:53.329
So

03:54.230 --> 03:56.079
you're not as fragile as you look.

03:56.079 --> 03:57.280
I don't have a choice.

03:57.600 --> 03:58.840
I need to survive.

03:59.610 --> 04:01.150
They sent you to kill me?

04:02.750 --> 04:04.610
I'm nothing
more than a female prisoner.

04:04.610 --> 04:06.290
I never did anything.

04:06.650 --> 04:07.360
But

04:08.120 --> 04:09.240
ever since you arrived,

04:09.240 --> 04:10.970
this place has become strange.

04:11.000 --> 04:14.290
I've never seen the present
target anyone like this before.

04:14.290 --> 04:15.440
Who exactly are you?

04:16.880 --> 04:18.290
Instead of asking me,

04:19.060 --> 04:21.589
maybe you should
ask yourself that question.

04:21.620 --> 04:22.550
What do you mean?

04:23.520 --> 04:25.850
You should know these tricks well enough.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.520
After all,

04:29.640 --> 04:31.840
you used to be one of them,

04:32.640 --> 04:33.600
didn't you?

04:36.200 --> 04:38.080
Voice-Keeper Taiyin.

04:44.310 --> 04:45.490
What are you talking about?

04:45.490 --> 04:46.620
I don't understand.

04:50.120 --> 04:51.380
How fitting.

04:51.650 --> 04:53.150
Do you remember

04:53.520 --> 04:54.600
this guiding ring?

04:55.840 --> 04:57.060
It isn't mine.

05:03.640 --> 05:04.400
Who are you?

05:04.580 --> 05:05.640
Who are you really?

05:05.720 --> 05:07.310
Where did you get that ring?

05:10.310 --> 05:12.640
Do you still remember Nan Shiren's family

05:12.680 --> 05:15.610
at the foot of Guitian Mountain
outside the capital?

05:17.730 --> 05:18.850
Nan Shiren...

05:18.870 --> 05:21.840
He once had a simple,
happy family of three.

05:21.980 --> 05:23.270
But one day,

05:23.920 --> 05:25.630
an assassin broke in

05:25.940 --> 05:27.800
and killed him in a single strike.

05:28.740 --> 05:31.340
His wife was also poisoned
with a deadly toxin,

05:32.280 --> 05:34.480
and to this day,
she's still bedridden.

05:37.540 --> 05:38.940
I already told you,

05:39.320 --> 05:40.260
I'm not...

06:01.090 --> 06:03.800
What kind of skill is it
to bully a child?

06:04.920 --> 06:06.500
A child?

06:07.530 --> 06:09.480
I thought so too at first.

06:09.500 --> 06:12.160
But I've been observing you
these past few days,

06:12.300 --> 06:14.890
and I've realized—
you're not a child at all.

06:14.910 --> 06:16.830
Your appearance can deceive people,

06:16.830 --> 06:19.250
but your real skin

06:20.460 --> 06:21.900
tells the truth.

06:29.180 --> 06:31.910
As expected—
fine on the outside, rotten within.

06:32.670 --> 06:34.600
Your body has already decayed,

06:34.760 --> 06:35.990
just like your heart.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.290
So,

06:37.560 --> 06:38.909
still going to deny it?

06:39.440 --> 06:40.560
Could it be…

06:41.570 --> 06:42.370
you are…

06:44.010 --> 06:45.010
I am.

06:46.880 --> 06:47.920
I am!

06:48.080 --> 06:49.040
Tell me—

06:49.120 --> 06:51.159
why did you kill my father? Why?

06:51.180 --> 06:52.800
He had already retired into the mountains,
living in seclusion.

06:52.800 --> 06:54.350
He stayed out of all worldly affairs.

06:54.350 --> 06:56.360
Why did you have to hunt him down
and kill him?

06:56.360 --> 06:57.960
Why?

06:59.440 --> 07:01.050
I have the antidote.

07:01.880 --> 07:03.250
If I die,

07:03.360 --> 07:04.200
your mother…

07:04.560 --> 07:06.250
your mother will die too.

07:19.050 --> 07:20.280
The Tower Master

07:20.370 --> 07:22.300
has been overworked again lately—

07:23.000 --> 07:24.630
you've even gotten more gray hairs.

07:24.630 --> 07:25.460
Well,

07:25.880 --> 07:27.600
can I not be overworked?

07:28.490 --> 07:30.410
If I don't worry more,

07:30.640 --> 07:33.480
Zhuang Wujiu will tear
the whole place down.

07:34.800 --> 07:36.600
Please calm down, Tower Master.

07:36.820 --> 07:39.020
Wujiu is just young.

07:39.200 --> 07:41.080
Once she's been through more,

07:41.120 --> 07:43.580
she'll come to understand your intentions.

07:57.640 --> 07:59.040
There's still something

07:59.280 --> 08:01.400
I can't quite put my mind
at ease about.

08:01.400 --> 08:03.600
Tower Master, please give your orders.

08:11.560 --> 08:14.020
I'm worried Wujiu won't be able
to bring herself to do it.

08:14.020 --> 08:15.750
If she can't go through with it…

08:16.400 --> 08:18.120
you'll need to help her.

08:20.890 --> 08:23.040
The poison your mother was given

08:23.110 --> 08:24.770
was personally crafted by me.

08:25.940 --> 08:27.730
Any standard antidote

08:28.080 --> 08:30.030
requires my blood—

08:30.440 --> 08:31.600
without it,

08:32.360 --> 08:34.470
no one can cure her.

09:00.560 --> 09:02.290
So you really can't be trusted.

09:03.250 --> 09:04.570
The antidote is real.

09:04.920 --> 09:06.570
But you must die tonight—

09:06.590 --> 09:09.190
otherwise I won't live
to see tomorrow either.

09:31.990 --> 09:32.990
Master!

09:38.260 --> 09:38.940
Master!

09:39.320 --> 09:40.120
The antidote!

09:40.160 --> 09:41.280
I found the antidote!

09:41.280 --> 09:42.520
My mother can be saved!

09:42.520 --> 09:43.430
Wujiu,

09:43.500 --> 09:45.280
why did you put your blade away?

09:45.490 --> 09:46.490
Keep going.

09:46.880 --> 09:48.600
I was sent by the Tower Master

09:48.600 --> 09:50.040
to keep an eye on you—

09:50.060 --> 09:52.140
don't disappoint him.

09:52.170 --> 09:53.010
Shut up!

09:57.960 --> 09:59.200
Do you still

09:59.200 --> 10:01.750
not know Zhuang Wujiu's real identity?

10:01.840 --> 10:02.740
Wan Hongliu,

10:02.760 --> 10:04.240
I told you to shut up!

10:10.920 --> 10:11.880
Nan Yanzhi,

10:12.160 --> 10:14.020
the Tower Master of Lingya Tower…

10:15.520 --> 10:16.750
is my father.

10:25.840 --> 10:26.640
Master…

10:26.810 --> 10:28.270
you're lying to me, right?

10:28.840 --> 10:30.110
You must be lying to me…

10:33.320 --> 10:35.120
How foolish.

10:35.520 --> 10:37.160
A little kindness

10:37.160 --> 10:38.820
and you believed everything.

10:38.960 --> 10:41.160
Back then, the order to wipe
out your entire family—

10:41.160 --> 10:42.120
that was given

10:43.040 --> 10:45.000
by me to Qi Songyue.

10:45.360 --> 10:46.410
Impossible…

10:47.480 --> 10:48.000
impossible…

10:48.000 --> 10:49.160
how could that be?

10:53.760 --> 10:55.960
We were the ones who saved you back then!

10:56.170 --> 10:57.680
I treated you like my own family—

10:57.680 --> 10:58.730
how could you?

10:59.640 --> 11:01.760
Then why didn't you kill me back then?

11:06.360 --> 11:07.880
Because watching you suffer

11:07.880 --> 11:09.180
and break apart

11:10.520 --> 11:11.920
is far more interesting.

11:12.640 --> 11:13.900
I taught you, didn't I?

11:14.280 --> 11:16.560
Never trust anyone.

11:18.360 --> 11:19.440
Master,

11:19.600 --> 11:21.200
tell me it's all a lie.

11:21.440 --> 11:22.600
You raised me,

11:23.320 --> 11:24.650
taught me martial arts,

11:24.840 --> 11:26.520
and took care of my family.

11:26.520 --> 11:29.110
You never let me suffer
even the slightest grievance.

11:29.110 --> 11:32.310
You were the one who kept me
from being consumed by hatred—

11:33.400 --> 11:36.400
you were the one
who made me look forward to the future.

11:37.240 --> 11:39.280
And now you tell me it was all fake?

11:39.360 --> 11:42.020
Well, who made your parents
build Lingya Tower?

11:42.240 --> 11:43.880
Your parents knew too many secrets—

11:43.880 --> 11:45.430
they were always destined to be silenced.

11:45.430 --> 11:46.760
I should even thank you.

11:47.840 --> 11:48.600
Without you

11:49.350 --> 11:51.080
bringing me into your home,

11:51.860 --> 11:53.440
I would never have found it.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.760
Even your entry into Lingya Tower
to retrieve the antidote—

11:59.760 --> 12:01.320
that was all part of my plan.

12:03.300 --> 12:04.310
I originally

12:04.520 --> 12:07.200
meant to keep you alive
and slowly torment you to death...

12:07.200 --> 12:08.160
but you

12:09.320 --> 12:10.650
turned out to be useful.

12:11.440 --> 12:12.240
So

12:14.440 --> 12:15.970
you were using me all along?

12:16.440 --> 12:17.280
Thanks to you,

12:18.260 --> 12:20.570
I was able to expose Kou Wan and Zan Hua,

12:20.800 --> 12:23.340
and wipe out

12:23.680 --> 12:25.080
all those hidden traitors.

12:25.080 --> 12:26.120
Impossible…

12:26.400 --> 12:28.800
you were clearly trapped
by this tower too.

12:29.200 --> 12:30.560
You barely escaped

12:30.560 --> 12:31.680
and finally learned
to live like a human again.

12:31.680 --> 12:33.550
You clearly despised everything

12:33.570 --> 12:35.120
about this place.

12:35.120 --> 12:36.360
Enough

12:37.280 --> 12:39.280
of your little drama.

12:39.400 --> 12:40.540
Zhuang Wujiu,

12:40.760 --> 12:43.930
the Tower Master
is running out of patience.

12:47.080 --> 12:49.120
Father, please spare Yanzhi!

12:49.120 --> 12:50.200
You've actually done

12:50.100 --> 12:54.750
♪ Longing lingers between your brows
after our long separation ♪

12:50.200 --> 12:51.120
so many treasonous things for her

12:51.120 --> 12:53.280
behind my back.

12:53.520 --> 12:54.980
If you weren't my daughter,

12:54.980 --> 12:56.920
I would have torn you to pieces.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.800
She only entered the tower
to find the antidote—

12:57.210 --> 13:01.050
♪ Words fail, so hear the insects
through the endless night ♪

12:58.830 --> 12:59.800
she meant no harm.

12:59.800 --> 13:00.840
Wujiu,

13:00.840 --> 13:02.400
you're far too naive.

13:02.640 --> 13:05.270
Do you really not know
Lingya Tower was built by her father?

13:03.610 --> 13:08.770
♪ Obsession melts to ink,
sorrow staining line by line ♪

13:05.360 --> 13:07.920
Do you not know
how her parents died?

13:07.920 --> 13:10.800
She came into the tower
to avenge her parents.

13:09.880 --> 13:15.390
♪ A short letter holds
ten thousand words left unsaid ♪

13:10.800 --> 13:12.950
So she must die.

13:13.880 --> 13:15.890
I'll give you one last chance—

13:15.920 --> 13:18.240
kill Nan Yanzhi with your own hands.

13:18.240 --> 13:21.750
Otherwise, I will show no mercy to anyone

13:18.350 --> 13:23.080
♪ Beneath the lamp,
we watched the days fade into dusk ♪

13:22.080 --> 13:24.040
who has ever helped you.

13:25.210 --> 13:28.950
♪ The strings are broken,
and love has vanished like clouds ♪

13:31.780 --> 13:36.910
♪ As splendor fades,
frost seals the heart shut ♪

13:38.570 --> 13:43.810
♪ Flowers bloom and wither, their fading
fragrance leaves silent heartbreak ♪

13:45.130 --> 13:50.810
♪ Half a life of longing—
who understands this devotion ♪

13:52.150 --> 13:57.970
♪ Beneath a lonely lamp, faint light
falls upon the mortal world ♪

13:59.410 --> 14:05.470
♪ The ink still dries, yet these feelings
remain bound to this world ♪

13:59.680 --> 14:00.660
Nan Yanzhi,

14:01.200 --> 14:03.670
don't you want revenge
for your parents?

14:03.720 --> 14:04.900
Then do it.

14:05.040 --> 14:07.510
This is your last chance.

14:06.480 --> 14:12.310
♪ Amid pine winds and bamboo shadows,
I watch the moon sink and stars drift ♪

14:07.560 --> 14:09.400
Let me see
whether the skills I taught you

14:09.400 --> 14:11.400
are enough for you to kill me.

14:13.360 --> 14:19.110
♪ Through years of blooms and falls,
every word stays buried within ♪

14:20.520 --> 14:26.380
♪ All beneath heaven are passing souls—
only my truest heart remains ♪

14:27.500 --> 14:33.830
♪ Half a lifetime wandering far and wide,
longing for home ♪

14:34.900 --> 14:41.220
♪ Having embraced the boundless stars,
this heart still walks toward the dawn ♪

14:53.290 --> 14:54.900
Your filigree bangle—

14:56.520 --> 14:58.220
take it back.

14:57.070 --> 15:01.770
♪ Beneath the lamp,
we watched the days fade into dusk ♪

15:04.180 --> 15:08.050
♪ The strings are broken,
and love has vanished like clouds ♪

15:10.170 --> 15:11.480
Zhuang Wujiu,

15:10.730 --> 15:15.810
♪ As splendor fades,
frost seals the heart shut ♪

15:11.680 --> 15:13.490
from this moment on,

15:15.110 --> 15:17.200
all ties between us are severed.

15:17.020 --> 15:22.480
♪ Flowers bloom and wither, their fading
fragrance leaves silent heartbreak ♪

15:23.970 --> 15:29.700
♪ Half a life of longing—
who understands this devotion ♪

15:31.140 --> 15:36.180
♪ Beneath a lonely lamp, faint light
falls upon the mortal world ♪

15:38.180 --> 15:44.170
♪ The ink still dries, yet these feelings
remain bound to this world ♪

15:45.480 --> 15:51.010
♪ Amid pine winds and bamboo shadows,
I watch the moon sink and stars drift ♪

15:52.640 --> 15:58.070
♪ Through years of blooms and falls,
every word stays buried within ♪

15:59.020 --> 16:04.850
♪ All beneath heaven are passing souls—
only my truest heart remains ♪

16:06.470 --> 16:12.660
♪ Half a lifetime wandering far and wide,
longing for home ♪

16:13.650 --> 16:17.360
♪ Having embraced the boundless stars,
this heart still journeys toward♪

16:19.460 --> 16:22.530
♪ The dawn ♪
